text:
@AppleSupport Hi! When someone calls, the volume of the tone of my iPhone X goes down suddenly. Why? 🤔
I’ve tried to restart, to change the tone... And nothing works. 
Thanks for your help

In NYC.Have free data roaming. iPhone keeps losing 3G signal. If I turn airplane mode on and off again, I get 3G for about a minute, then lose it again.

Anyone any ideas for a fix?

@122326 @applesupport

historical_reply:
@135688 We would like to try a couple of different troubleshooting steps regarding your Mac. There’s a few settings that we can help reset that may clear up your issue.

First would be an SMC reset: https://t.co/FYojVXHuwn

Second would be a NVRAM reset: https://t.co/sf0JEbUJVS
